### OLYMPOS Phase 0 — REST Client
### Cursor / VS Code: REST Client 拡張で各ブロックを実行

@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### 匿名登録
# @name register
POST {{base}}/v1/participants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "gender_identity": "male",
  "target_gender": "female",
  "age_band": "25-29",
  "area": "東京23区",
  "role": "host",
  "required_age_bands": ["25-29"],
  "preferred_age_bands": ["25-29"],
  "availability": ["2026-10-03T10", "2026-10-04T13", "2026-10-10T10"],
  "portrait_opt_in": false
}

### アンケート
POST {{base}}/v1/surveys
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participant_id": "{{register.response.body.id}}",
  "participation_intent": 4,
  "payment_intent": 4,
  "price_plan": "iap-baseline",
  "usability_score": 4,
  "comment": "API確認"
}

### 匿名編成
POST {{base}}/v1/simulations

### KPI
GET {{base}}/v1/kpis
